{"problem_id": "einsteinarena/third-autocorrelation-inequality", "rank": 1, "decision": "switch_candidate", "rationale": "Only problem with literature headroom of many delta under the same verifier AND a way to reach it tonight. MILO (arXiv:2609.38349, App. E) claims 1.4488860143 on 25,600 grid points, scored with the arena verifier, 22 delta below the live #1; its construction is not published and not on the leaderboard. Its project page publishes a plot-resolution copy of the record (3,200 of the 25,600 values, 6 decimals), which scores 1.6558 as given. Block-repeating that copy x8 and re-optimizing it with one log-sum-exp cooling path (our re-implementation, 5 to 7 minutes on one core) gives candidates that the pinned verifier scores 23.7 to 28.5 delta below the live #1 and 1.3 to 6.1 delta below MILO's claimed value (seven candidates: five direct paths, one re-melt hop, one x2 cascade; all below both); an independent exact-rational scorer agrees to 1.3e-15. Without that starting point the same method gains nothing from the live #1 in 5 minutes (0 delta) and 0.4 delta from BasinHopper's solution in 40 s. The candidates derive from MILO's published data and must be credited to it: whether that counts as our record is Arthur's call. Evaluation is cheap (FFT of 51,200 to 262,144 points), so CPU is enough.", "evidence_urls": ["https://einsteinarena.com/problems/third-autocorrelation-inequality", "https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.38349", "https://jprithwish.github.io/MILO/", "https://jprithwish.github.io/MILO/static/einstein-run.js", "https://einsteinarena.com/problems/third-autocorrelation-inequality/threads/181", "https://teorth.github.io/optimizationproblems/constants/1d.html", "https://discoveria.ai/frontiers/einsteinarena-third-autocorrelation"], "checked_on": "2026-11-15T04:37:05+00:00", "direction": "minimize", "delta": 1e-05, "live_top1": {"agent": "Atris", "score": 1.449109789331911, "created_at": "2026-10-13T22:46:20.355Z", "source": "https://einsteinarena.com/problems/third-autocorrelation-inequality", "accessed_on": "2026-11-15T04:37:05+00:00", "label": "verified: pinned verifier reproduces 1.449109789331911 in a clean process; exact rational score 1.4491097893319105"}, "live_top2": {"agent": "Ghazt", "score": 1.449121951852342}, "gap_1_2_over_delta": 1.2162520431013846, "within_delta_of_1": 0, "days_since_top1": 32.2, "top_created_last_30d": 1, "gain_over_best_older_than_60d_over_delta": 169.68501733725105, "literature": [{"value": 1.4488860142647635, "what": "MILO record, 25,600 grid points, 2026-09-15", "source": "https://jprithwish.github.io/MILO/ (demo data static/einstein-run.js) and https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.38349 (App. E.1, Table 13: 1.4488860143)", "accessed_on": "2026-11-15", "definition_matches_verifier": true, "definition_note": "paper: 'minimize |max(f*f)| / (int f)^2, f signed', 'rescored with the arena's own verifier'; same quantity as the pinned verifier", "label": "claim: the construction is not public; we reproduced the basin, not their exact value"}, {"value": 1.4557, "what": "AlphaEvolve, C' (signed max)", "source": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.02864", "accessed_on": "2026-11-14", "definition_matches_verifier": true, "label": "read in source"}, {"value": 1.457854884921989, "what": "Tao's table constant 1d = max |f*f| / (int f)^2", "source": "https://teorth.github.io/optimizationproblems/constants/1d.html", "accessed_on": "2026-11-15", "definition_matches_verifier": false, "label": "not comparable: a different constant (abs inside the max)"}], "method_evidence": ["MILO App. E.2: log-sum-exp objective with FFT gradient, L-BFGS stages on a geometric cooling ladder, chain of re-melt hops with multiplicative jitter, 60 s runs, on 25,600 points, started from arena rank 3 (BasinHopper, 1.4515829).", "MILO project page: the run took 12.7 days to its record and 11.8 days to go below today's live #1; 41 harness evaluations, 403 sub-record constructions (claim).", "Forum t181 (JSAgent, untrusted): block-repeat + noise + re-optimization gains at each resolution doubling; a reply fits C(n) = C_inf + A/n with A about 1.6 in that basin (claim)."], "unverified": ["MILO's own value (construction not public).", "Server-side score of our candidates (nothing was submitted; server numpy version is not pinned).", "Whether a result derived from MILO's published replay is acceptable as the team's record.", "The problem is not frozen in problems/: verify_claim.py has not arbitrated these candidates."], "to_freeze_if_switch": ["verifier_pinned.py: sha256 b8288d5943d72032... (live == pinned on 2026-11-15, see registry_stage2)", "certificate: live #1, solution 2617 (Atris), 65,536 values, score 1.449109789331911", "independent.py: selection/scout_third_autocorr_exact.py (exact rationals, Kronecker substitution)", "record to beat: the lower of the live #1 and MILO's claimed 1.4488860142647635, minus delta"], "candidates": [{"tag": "milo_replay_25600_c_remelt", "n": 25600, "score_pinned": 1.448825267560211, "stored_file": "selection/scout_candidates/third-autocorrelation-inequality/milo_replay_25600_c_remelt.json.gz", "solution_sha256": "6262db4f37d66e8087be46cb1f01231360a5562242f1591a1243c6ebb9e128f2", "wall_s": 420.0, "label": "verified (pinned verifier, clean process); candidate, not a record claim"}, {"tag": "milo_replay_25600_c", "n": 25600, "score_pinned": 1.448827989657653, "stored_file": "selection/scout_candidates/third-autocorrelation-inequality/milo_replay_25600_c.json.gz", "solution_sha256": "dd1f75f8a9f38332171d538458b709d6510a95160c595e45c85844a98946fc5f", "wall_s": 420.0, "label": "verified (pinned verifier, clean process); candidate, not a record claim"}, {"tag": "milo_replay_25600_e", "n": 25600, "score_pinned": 1.448835478669337, "stored_file": "selection/scout_candidates/third-autocorrelation-inequality/milo_replay_25600_e.json.gz", "solution_sha256": "18e6520db96ecfda0bdf98e3250e6ea8527b3070980d2fc600b1f4c091f3c40b", "wall_s": 420.0, "label": "verified (pinned verifier, cle